from filename "../../module/learn.pya" to name learn be import do

ob filename text source be input ya
ob filename text cards be input ya
ob text text learning_focus be input ya

su name source stage from filename of ob of source become wo text to name text learn source text be read do
su name cards stage from filename of ob of cards become wo text to name text learn cards text be read do
su name merged card stage from text of ob of learn cards text with text of ob of learning_focus to name text merged card be learn merge cards do
su name refined card stage from text of ob of merged card with text of ob of learning_focus to name text refined card be learn refine card do
su name learning source support verify stage from text of ob of learn source text with text of ob of refined card to name text learning source support pass be learning source support do
ob text of ob of learning source support pass be equally from text "FAIL" then
ob bool lie fromtext text "learning source support defective" be guarantee do
su name result out ob text of ob of refined card be write do
